      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents | Team Josh Dixon is delighted to present a beautiful 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom family home in the heart of Drogheda. This property is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, second-time buyers, or investors.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you'll find a spacious hallway leading to the ground floor, which features a large living room, a downstairs bathroom, and a kitchen/dining room. The second level comprises three double bedrooms, a smaller bedroom, an en-suite, and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property is a timber frame built with a redbrick and pebbledash render exterior at the front, and pebbledash render on the rear and sides. It also includes wooden fascia, soffit, uPVC guttering, and downpipes.\r\n\r\nThe location offers exceptional convenience with easy access to the train station, bus routes, and the M1 motorway. Popular local establishments like The Black Bull and Bryanstown Social are within walking distance. Bryanstown Village and Southgate Shopping Centre provide essential amenities such as doctors, pharmacists, hair salons, barbers, and butchers. Drogheda town center, along with national and secondary schools, are also within walking distance.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n*All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided to us by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have.*"
      },
